<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Computer Sciences rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Computer Sciences rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said analyst Gary Helmig initiated coverage of Computer Sciences Corp with a near-term and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $3.40 for the 1998 year, ending next March.</p>
<p>-- shares ended up one to 67-7/8 on Monday.</p>
